  "reviewer_note": "Historiography of Tipu is contested; this outline stays descriptive and records only dates, the wars and the tiger emblem as stated by EBSCO and the V&A, with no assessment of his rule. Birth year is 1749 or 1753 in EBSCO (start year uses 1749). The pin is his capital and place of death (Seringapatam), not his birthplace, which was not found on opened pages. The V&A says the ruler was killed as the army swept into the city in 1799.",
